&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Support Manager to lead a connected and deeply technical team dedicated to delivering an easy-going, memorable customer experience. Working under the APJ Director of Global Support Engineering, this person will have full accountability for the results of their Support Engineering team, with high-level coordination and recommendations to other customer experience partners including the overall Global Technical Services team, Engineering, Product and Go To Market (GTM).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team&#39;s main purpose is to ensure our customers love New Relic software. The Manager of Global Support Engineering needs a track record of successful support operations management in a fast-growth environment.&lt;/p&gt;
